      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPNjhyY1I1V3hVazd1eHJqOHFWeWFNWmFzQXpUb0Z4YS04TWR2ZW9KQzc3bWRmVmxIeDRaOHNpVFlyVDF1UE1pSl90SnlfZ3kwMXQtXzZnOEFVNzZHakx5ZmV1SlNXRU91M2N0aWtTMW9GQlZOdUROOUdHSnExT1otenZ5VnM?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
