     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · ESPN Cricinfo · 2026-10-07 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Dogra and Nasir Secure First-Innings Lead for Jammu &amp; Kashmir</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#cricket</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Jammu &amp; Kashmir secured a first-innings lead of 41 runs against Rest of India during their Irani Cup match in Srinagar. Despite being in a precarious position at 166 for 8, a rearguard effort allowed the team to surpass Rest of India’s first-innings total of 237. Lone Nasir contributed a significant 64 off 58 balls while batting at number 10.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-07/dogra-and-nasir-secure-first-innings-lead-for-jammu-kashmir.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The match, which saw Rest of India trailing by 17 runs at the conclusion of the second day, was characterized by strong performances from local heroes. Fast bowlers initially dominated the Srinagar pitch, effectively dismantling the Rest of India lineup before the late-order batting recovery shifted the momentum.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately reflects the scorecard details and match situation provided in the brief source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.cricinfo.com/ci/content/story/1556925.html?ex_cid=OTC-RSS" rel="noopener">ESPN Cricinfo</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/jammu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jammu</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
