       <h1>Kieran Culkin Expresses Desire to Continue Playing the Devil on 'Family Guy'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Kieran Culkin enjoyed playing the Devil on the animated television show &quot;Family Guy&quot; so much that he wants to continue the role for the foreseeable future. According to production insights, Culkin was very game and eager to have fun with the character during his appearance. At the conclusion of his work on the show, the actor explicitly insisted on returning to play the Devil if the production revisits the character in future episodes. The exclusive details highlight the actor's enthusiasm for the animated guest role.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-07/kieran-culkin-expresses-desire-to-continue-playing-the-devil.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
