      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/social-tracker-cricket/joburg-super-kings-sign-kieron-pollard-for-r15-million-at-sa20-2027-auction-7934/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
