      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/narendra-modi-lk-advani-meeting-bjp-25-years-public-office-3011895-2026-10-07?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
