       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-07 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Radhikka Madan Praises Ali Fazal Following Lust Stories 3 Collaboration</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Radhikka Madan has lauded co-star Ali Fazal as a phenomenal and versatile actor following their work in the Lust Stories 3 segment directed by Shakun Batra. Released on September 18, the project highlighted Fazal's ability to portray vulnerable characters, contrasting with his performance as Guddu in the upcoming Mirzapur: The Movie.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-07/radhikka-madan-praises-ali-fazal-following-lust-stories-3-co.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Fazal’s range has earned him significant online attention, including the internet-coined &quot;pookie&quot; tag. Madan noted that the collaboration was creatively satisfying, citing his adaptability across diverse roles as a key strength in their recent professional partnership.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively synthesizes the source material, capturing the professional praise and the specific context of the roles mentioned.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/radhikka-madan-calls-ali-fazal-phenomenal-and-full-of-bizarre-ideas-as-internet-crowns-him-the-new-pookie/articleshow/134638439.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
