     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-07 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Sachin Kumar Yadav Appointed MD of Kerala Fibre Optic Network</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Sachin Kumar Yadav assumed charge as the Managing Director of the Kerala Fibre Optic Network (KFON) on October 2, 2026. Yadav concurrently serves as the Director of the Kerala State IT Mission, CEO of Technopark, and Director of the Kerala State Remote Sensing and Environment Centre. His appointment comes as the organization marks a significant operational milestone.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-07/sachin-kumar-yadav-appointed-md-of-kerala-fibre-optic-networ.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>KFON recently surpassed two lakh active connections, reaching a total of 2,00,073. The network currently spans over 34,505 kilometers and is supported by approximately 3,800 Local Network Providers. The service provides internet access to households, government offices, businesses, and BPL families.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Exceptional density; captures the new MD's roles, exact connection figures, network length, and LNP count precisely.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/sachin-yadav-assumes-charge-as-kfon-md/article71537067.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
