       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-07 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>T-Series Releases 'Shayad' Romantic Track From Main Na Raha Mera Voiced by Rekha Bhardwaj</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>T-Series has released 'Shayad', a new romantic track from the upcoming project Main Na Raha Mera, featuring actors Adhyayan Suman and Divita Rai. The song explores unspoken relationship emotions like vulnerability and longing through an intimate musical treatment composed by Rahul Nair with lyrics by Dev Pandey. Veteran singer Rekha Bhardwaj provided the vocals, utilizing her distinctive texture to give the composition a personal, lived-in character. Main Na Raha Mera is written and directed by Amit Kasaria and produced by Dharmesh Sangani.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-07/t-series-releases-shayad-romantic-track-from-main-na-raha-me.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately details the release, personnel, and themes of the song based on the source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/shayad-song-from-main-na-raha-mera-out-now-rekha-bhardwaj-voices-adhyayan-suman-and-divita-rais-romantic-track/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
